I want to be an active local voice who follows up with the council to get the basics right and to deliver for our community: affordable housing for families, protecting our green spaces and improving schools and services for young people so families have absolute confidence in their children’s education and wellbeing.','2026-09-19T15:51:53Z',0) on conflict (ballot_paper_id,dc_person_id) do update set statement_to_voters=coalesce(excluded.statement_to_voters,candidates.statement_to_voters), statement_to_voters_present=excluded.statement_to_voters_present or candidates.statement_to_voters_present, homepage_url=coalesce(excluded.homepage_url,candidates.homepage_url);
